---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Terms of Service | EvictionNoticeGenerator.com';
const description = 'Terms of service for EvictionNoticeGenerator.com — free eviction notice generator for US landlords.';
---
<Base {title} {description}>
  <main class="bg-brand-bg py-section-y">
    <article class="max-w-content mx-auto px-6">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-h1 font-bold text-brand-heading mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-small text-brand-muted mb-8">Last updated: August 2026</p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-heading mt-10 mb-4">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p class="font-body text-body-base text-brand-body mb-4">By accessing or using EvictionNoticeGenerator.com, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use this site.</p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-heading mt-10 mb-4">No Legal Advice</h2>
      <p class="font-body text-body-base text-brand-body mb-4">EvictionNoticeGenerator.com provides document templates and general information for educational purposes only. Nothing on this site constitutes legal advice, and no attorney-client relationship is formed by your use of this service. Eviction laws vary by state and locality and change frequently. You are responsible for verifying that any notice you serve complies with current applicable law.</p>
      <p class="font-body text-body-base text-brand-body mb-4">We strongly recommend consulting a licensed attorney before serving any eviction notice, particularly in complex situations involving rent-controlled properties, just-cause eviction jurisdictions, or tenants who dispute the notice.</p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-heading mt-10 mb-4">Use of the Service</h2>
      <ul class="font-body text-body-base text-brand-body mb-4 pl-6 space-y-2 list-disc">
        <li>You may use this service only for lawful purposes and in accordance with applicable law.</li>
        <li>You are solely responsible for the accuracy of information you enter into our generator.</li>
        <li>You may not use this service to generate notices for fraudulent or illegal purposes.</li>
        <li>Documents generated are for your personal use only and may not be resold or redistributed.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-heading mt-10 mb-4">Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p class="font-body text-body-base text-brand-body mb-4">This service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not warrant that the documents generated are legally sufficient for your specific jurisdiction or situation, that the statutory notice periods shown are current, or that the service will be error-free or uninterrupted.</p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-heading mt-10 mb-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="font-body text-body-base text-brand-body mb-4">To the maximum extent permitted by law, EvictionNoticeGenerator.com and its operators shall not be liable for any damages arising from your use of this service, including but not limited to: an eviction case being dismissed due to a defective notice, loss of rental income, or attorney fees incurred as a result of relying on documents generated by this service.</p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-heading mt-10 mb-4">Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="font-body text-body-base text-brand-body mb-4">The content, design, and functionality of this website are owned by EvictionNoticeGenerator.com. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without our express written permission.</p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-heading mt-10 mb-4">Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p class="font-body text-body-base text-brand-body mb-4">We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-heading mt-10 mb-4">Contact</h2>
      <p class="font-body text-body-base text-brand-body mb-4">Questions about these terms? Use our <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-cta hover:underline font-semibold">Contact page</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
